    "sentence_translations": [
      "(5) Let’s Go See a Movie",
      "",
      "This Saturday, Qian Duoduo didn’t go to school, and she didn’t work.",
      "She wanted to go with her mom to the movie theater to see a movie together.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo said, “Mom, this Saturday, let’s go see a movie. What do you think?”",
      "",
      "Her mom said, “Sure, what shall we see?”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo said, “This Saturday, the movie theater has Titanic in 3D. I want to go see it.”",
      "",
      "Mom thought about it and said, “Titanic … then the two of us will go and see it.",
      "Uncle Xie and your little brother will go to the park to play.",
      "",
      "“Okay!” Qian Duoduo said.",
      "",
      "“Movie! Movie! I want to watch a movie!” Her little brother arrived.",
      "",
      "Mom said, “Mom and your big sister are going to see a movie.",
      "You and Dad will go to the park to play with the big airplane. How about that?”",
      "",
      "Her little brother said, “No! I want to go see a movie! Mom, Mom, I want to see a movie with you.”"
    ]
